        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "Takes — Basic Switching Demo\n\nThis patch demonstrates the Take system.\n\n1. Open the Take panel (toggle 'Takes' in toolbar)\n2. Click 'Capture Base' to snapshot current state\n3. Change some parameters (color, count, spacing, etc.)\n4. Type a name and click 'Capture Take'\n5. Click 'Revert to Base' to restore\n6. Click a take in the list to apply it instantly\n\nTakes store only parameters that differ from Base\n(sparse delta), so they are lightweight.",
